":\"L'era dell'acquario\",\"overview\":\"Chiara wants a better future...written on her palm. The Professor shares a secret passion for astrology with Tobia, the studio's admin manager.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rMCFOEWRXVWby4gkRuy8xtMFC5t.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-25\",\"runtime\":9},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"La sobrietà della politica\",\"overview\":\"Susanna has decided to go into politics and wants a new look. Esther brings her back on the right track. Sergio and Vanessa are officially a couple.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2wAPzrhjUdMyYUYXMLSsjEgwiow.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-26\",\"runtime\":9},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Un gesto romantico\",\"overview\":\"Bruno's manager Arturo wants the rapper to get a new look at the studio. Vanessa is a fan of Bruno and Marco tries to take advantage.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2wAPzrhjUdMyYUYXMLSsjEgwiow.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-29\",\"runtime\":11},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"La verità su Doris\",\"overview\":\"Chiara wants her \\\"best friend\\\" to get a touch-up. Ester needs new likes while Tobia is hiding a terrible secret about Doris, the Professor's goldfish.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/d5WT9i0tWSLsVWrNPnyXg8hkknE.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-30\",\"runtime\":7},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Voglia di...\",\"overview\":\"Vanessa has odd symptoms and Marco has a guess. The Professor struggles with Giuseppe, who wants a treatment to finally fix things with his mother.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lJhVBg9YYsS1gO6FXCVCINnLrmL.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-31\",\"runtime\":9},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Le tartarughe di Linosa\",\"overview\":\"Marisa presents her \\\"beloved\\\" stepdaughter Ada to the Professor. They couldn't be more different; thanks to Ester's help, they manage to compromise.\",\"